  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joe William Consultancy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CAFOD Sri Lanka Programme Consultant has been associated with CAFOD since 2001.  His connections to state and non-state actors in Sri Lanka, to the diplomatic community, to NGOs engaged in conflict transformation, to UN bodies as well as to regional human rights networks enable CAFOD to maintain an up-to-date analysis of political developments in Sri Lanka and to provide appropriate and timely support to partners.  The Programme Consultant has been engaged for some years in post-graduate research with the University of Bradford&#x2019;s Peace Studies Centre, and was awarded his PhD in 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
